#. tiler.js:1200
msgid "Main Left"
msgstr "左主窗"

#. tiler.js:1202
msgid ""
"The focused window keeps the left half. The rest share the right, each "
"newcomer halving the largest cell."
msgstr "当前窗口保留左半屏。其余窗口共享右半屏，每个新窗口都会将最大的单元格一分为二。"

#. tiler.js:1207
msgid "Main Right"
msgstr "右主窗"

#. tiler.js:1209
msgid ""
"The focused window keeps the right half. The rest share the left, each "
"newcomer halving the largest cell."
msgstr "当前窗口保留右半屏。其余窗口共享左半屏，每个新窗口都会将最大的单元格一分为二。"

#. tiler.js:1214
msgid "Equal Left"
msgstr "左均分"

#. tiler.js:1216
msgid ""
"Every window shares the screen, led from the left, each newcomer halving the "
"largest cell."
msgstr "所有窗口共享屏幕，从左侧开始，每个新窗口都会将最大的单元格一分为二。"

#. tiler.js:1221
msgid "Equal Right"
msgstr "右均分"

#. tiler.js:1223
msgid ""
"Every window shares the screen, led from the right, each newcomer halving the"
" largest cell."
msgstr "所有窗口共享屏幕，从右侧开始，每个新窗口都会将最大的单元格一分为二。"

